      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-6">Powitania.pl Voiceover Studio - Why Choose Us?</h2>
      <div class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-center">
        <p>Powitania.pl is a professional voiceover studio operating since 2001. We offer recordings with <%= voiceCount %> voice artists in 30+ languages - from advertising spots and IVR phone announcements to audiobooks and film narrations. We have completed over 11,000 projects for clients including Hyundai, Allegro, DHL, TVN, Volvo, Orange Polska, the Polish Ministry of Education, Play and Asseco.</p>
        <p>Looking for a voice that will effectively capture your customers' attention and build a professional image of your brand? As a voiceover studio with over 25 years of experience, we offer much more than recordings - we deliver emotions that sell.</p>
        <p>Whether you need a dynamic radio spot, professional IVR announcement, or engaging web message - our recording studio will be your partner in creating communication at the highest level. We approach each project individually, ensuring your message stands out and builds customer trust.</p>
        <p>We provide complete voice-over services - from voice talent casting and client script verification, through broadcast-quality recording, to mastering and file delivery in the required format. Each voice-over service includes recording in a professional studio, loudness normalization, mastering and file delivery in the required format. For advertising spots we record 3 interpretation versions; for other recording types we deliver two or one depending on project complexity; additional versions, express delivery or longer formats are priced individually - no hidden line items; minor revisions are free.</p>
        <p>Check our <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="text-accent hover:underline">voice bank</a> and discover how professional voiceovers can transform the quality of your brand.</p>
